flowchart TB
  UI[React UI] --> Client[Supabase browser client]
  Server[TanStack server functions] --> UserClient[User-scoped server client]
  Client --> Auth[Supabase Auth]
  Client --> Data[Data API]
  Client --> Storage[Private Storage]
  Client --> Edge[Edge Functions]
  UserClient --> Auth
  UserClient --> Data
  Data --> Grants[Explicit grants]
  Grants --> RLS[RLS ownership and role policy]
  RLS --> Tables[(37 public tables)]
  Storage --> StoragePolicy[Bucket and path policies plus quota]
  StoragePolicy --> Buckets[(7 private buckets)]
  Data --> RPC[Public RPC API]
  Edge --> Worker[Auth, feedback, logging, cleanup and deletion]
  Secret[Service secret] -. server-only narrow path .-> Worker
  Secret -. never .-> UI
